{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Select Studio Graphite Console from Options > Themes after installing. Install ReaImGui 0.10 or later for Transport Buttons settings, js_ReaScriptAPI for both Folder Annex buttons, and SWS/S&M Extension for the mixer annex. These packages are available in ReaTeam Extensions. Default app buttons find supported scripts in the current install's Main Action List.\par}
}
]]></description>
